C2. SCOPED SERVER AUTHORITY — CONFIRMED (source level)
    auth.ts:19-27  adapters are injected server dependencies; doc bans decoded-JWT /
        getSession cache / request-JSON hydration / metadata roles.
    supabase.ts:13-16  config from trusted server configuration; per request/bearer/
        workspace; :30 browser runtime refused at construction; :44 re-refused per op.
